{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14693","headline":"少女生日感怀 · 戴叔伦","name":"少女生日感怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五逢晬日今方见，置尔怀中自惘然。\n乍喜老身辞远役，翻悲一笑隔重泉。\n欲教针线娇难解，暂弄琴书性已便。\n还有蔡家残史籍，可能分与外人传。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14693.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14693","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}